{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54604","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师在道，或始出郊城。\n雷雨如倾溪涧阻，沐（京本作「淋」）屍凶象不堪行，勿要（辛本、川本作「足」）与天争。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}